0 -12 Td
(`Load Calculator Pro` estimates:) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(- running load \(kW and kVA\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
(- peak starting kVA \(largest motor start logic\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
