0 -12 Td
(1. Open `index.html` in a modern browser.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. No internet or server is required.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. All save/autosave data stays in the current browser on the current device.) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Fast workflow \(recommended\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
